<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>These lists represent the best possible gear obtainable before entering any raid. There are multiple sets because the three raids in Phase 1 will release over time, one by one, and with them bringing new Celestial Dungeon gear - therefore the best pre-raid set will change with every new raid release. Keep in mind that achieving full "best-in-slot" for any given content phase is typically an unrealistic goal, particularly so for pre-raid lists, as you will usually enter raids long before obtaining all the listed items; in that regard, these lists are more of a guideline to aim for.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-first-in-row="true" data-href="#bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_jadeserpent.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-msv-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></span>MSV Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-hof-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_agi.jpg");'></span>HoF Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-toes-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.jpg");'></span>ToES Release</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 1) prior to <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a> opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. This list allocates 3,200x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and 4,000x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> as the budget for purchasable items, as this is the most you can get before raids release.<br/>
<br/>
<i>Notably, the best weapon from heroic dungeons, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87542/mogudar-blade-of-the-thousand-slaves">
<img alt="Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves</span></a>, has an extremely low drop rate. The next-best option would be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82822/gravetouch-greatsword">
<img alt="Gravetouch Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_113.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gravetouch Greatsword</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82814/mograines-immaculate-might">
<img alt="Mograine's Immaculate Might" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mograine's Immaculate Might</span></a> - Dwarves should take the mace, otherwise they perform equally. </i>
