<br/>There are also random world drops <i>(bind-on-equip)</i> that can be considered pre-raid BiS here, but they will be incredibly rare &amp; expensive, and thus unreasonable for most players to obtain:<ul class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90582/buc-zakai-memento">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Memento" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Memento</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90580/cristofs-crushing-cloak">
<img alt="Cristof's Crushing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cristof's Crushing Cloak</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90579/legplates-of-durable-dreams">
<img alt="Legplates of Durable Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Durable Dreams</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90581/jan-hos-unwavering-seal">
<img alt="Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal</span></a></div></li></ul>
<div class="clear"></div></div>
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-msv-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall pre-raid gear available after the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a> in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 1), including the first wave of Celestial Dungeon items. The Celestial versions of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a> items will become available two weeks after the raid has released. This list allocates 8,000x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and 16,000x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> as the budget for purchasable items, as this is the limit you can acquire one week after the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a> Celestial variants become available, and includes two World Boss items. <br/>
<br/>If you are a playing a Dwarf Paladin with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=20864/mace-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>, then buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84785/malevolent-gladiators-bonegrinder">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Bonegrinder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pvppandarias1_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Bonegrinder</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84790/malevolent-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvppandarias1_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
