<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-hof-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall pre-raid gear available after the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a> in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 1), including the second wave of Celestial Dungeon items and the first Tier 14 items, allowing us to equip the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=123108/item-paladin-t14-retribution-2p-bonus">2-set bonus</a>. The Celestial versions of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a> items will become available two weeks after the raid has released. This list has no limit on the maximum budget of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> currency for purchasable items, and includes two World Boss items.<br/>
<br/>If you are a playing a Dwarf Paladin with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=20864/mace-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>, then buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84785/malevolent-gladiators-bonegrinder">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Bonegrinder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pvppandarias1_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Bonegrinder</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84790/malevolent-gladiators-greatsword">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Greatsword" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pvppandarias1_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Greatsword</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
