<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-toes-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall pre-raid gear available after the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrace of Endless Spring</span></a> in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 1), including the third wave of Celestial Dungeon items and the final Tier 14 items, allowing us to equip the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=70762/item-paladin-t10-retribution-4p-bonus">4-set bonus</a>. The Celestial versions of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrace of Endless Spring</span></a> items will become available two weeks after the raid has released. This list has no limit on the maximum budget of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> currency for Valor Points purchases, and includes two World Boss items.<br/>
<br/>
