<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="heroic-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvecurrency-valor.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 1 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, world bosses, etc, it is not a true "best in slot" list, but instead more of a rough guideline and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects. <br/>
<br/>Notably, the best weapon from heroic dungeons, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87542/mogudar-blade-of-the-thousand-slaves">
<img alt="Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves</span></a>, has an extremely low drop rate.<br/>
<br/>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="exclude-units grid" style="width: 900px; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c2">
<b>Item Slot</b></td>
<td data-background="c2">
<b>Name</b></td>
<td data-background="c2">
<b>Source</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Helm</td>
<td>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81241/meteoric-greathelm">
<img alt="Meteoric Greathelm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplate_c_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meteoric Greathelm</span></a></td>
<td>
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6182/mogushan-palace">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Palace</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
