<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria also includes a number of open world mobs and world bosses that also offer the chance to obtain powerful, high level epics. This includes Rare Mobs <i>("silver elites")</i> like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a>, but also World Bosses such as <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">Galleon &amp; Salyis' Warband</a> and the <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Additionally, there are a number of valuable random world drop epics that are bind-on-equip. These can be purchased off the auction house if you have the gold to spare and aren't insanely lucky enough to have one drop for you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">Galleon &amp; Salyis' Warband</a> drops a number of notable bind-on-pickup 496 ilvl epic offpieces:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90456/cord-of-crazed-strength">
<img alt="Cord of Crazed Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Crazed Strength</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90433/mushan-riders-collar">
<img alt="Mushan Rider's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mushan Rider's Collar</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90425/carapace-of-crushed-conviction">
<img alt="Carapace of Crushed Conviction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carapace of Crushed Conviction</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90414/greathelm-of-the-monstrous-mushan">
<img alt="Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90447/stompers-of-vigorous-stomping">
<img alt="Stompers of Vigorous Stomping" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stompers of Vigorous Stomping</span></a></div></li></ul>Obtaining any of these items can save you <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3350/august-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Fragment</span></span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> that you won't need to spend on other items. One of the most useful items here is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a>, which is best-in-slot all the way until <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrace of Endless Spring</span></a> releases, which is the third and final raid to release in Phase 1. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90456/cord-of-crazed-strength">
<img alt="Cord of Crazed Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Crazed Strength</span></a> is also best-in-slot until the second raid <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a> releases.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is a very notable world boss because it drops Tier 14 legs &amp; gloves with an item level of 496, which is the same item level acquired from Normal difficulty raids and better than all of the Celestial tier. If you get lucky and pick up one of these T14 items, you'll be off to a stellar start in Phase 1. <br/>
<br/>If you are looking to PvP during Phase 1, you can also obtain various 483 ilvl Malevolent Gladiator's set pieces and offpieces from this boss.<br/>
<br/>Additionally, you should aim to kill it at least once early on, if you can, because the first time you kill the Sha of Anger it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be handed in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90912/angerforged-stompers">
<img alt="Angerforged Stompers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Angerforged Stompers</span></a>, a fantastic pair of boots early in Phase 1.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are also Rare Mobs (aka "silver elites") sprinkled around the Pandaria open world with their own unique drops. Now, the majority of these unique drops are either toys, cosmetics, or similar items - but a small handful can drop useful epic items for PvE content.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a> - ilvl 420 weapon</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50352/qunas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> - ilvl 440 leggings</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50355/kahtir">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kah'tir</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87218/big-bag-of-arms">
<img alt="Big Bag of Arms" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Big Bag of Arms</span></a> - can contain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50344/norlaxx">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Norlaxx</span></a> drops <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87220/big-bag-of-mysteries">
<img alt="Big Bag of Mysteries" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_enchantedmageweave.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Big Bag of Mysteries</span></a> - can contain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=51059/blackhoof">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackhoof</span></a> drops <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86565/battle-horn">
<img alt="Battle Horn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_horn_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Battle Horn</span></a>, an incredibly useful pulling tool for Challenge Modes</div></li></ul>There is not much else in the way of PvE items to be obtained from these Rare Mobs, other than low-level <span class="q3">rare quality items</span> that are outclassed before you even reach level 90. In future phases, there will be new Rare Mobs with new rare drops.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="random-world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_coin_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Random World Drops</span></h3>These are bind-on-equip <span class="q4">epic quality items</span> that have a very low chance to drop from mobs all over the open world - most people will only ever obtain items like these by purchasing them on the auction house, and they will be incredibly expensive early on In Phase 1, where the item level of these random BoE drops is relatively high at 476; therefore it would be wise to keep your eyes peeled for them if you have lots of extra cash to burn, but most players will not be lucky or wealthy enough to obtain these items before they pick up something better in raids or Celestial Dungeons.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90582/buc-zakai-memento">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Memento" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Memento</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90580/cristofs-crushing-cloak">
<img alt="Cristof's Crushing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cristof's Crushing Cloak</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90579/legplates-of-durable-dreams">
