<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> in order to begin the quest to obtain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90592/ferocious-necklace-of-the-golden-lotus">
