<img alt="Rigid River's Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid River's Heart</span></a></div></li>
