<img alt="Lightning Wild Jade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_green.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Wild Jade</span></a></div></li></ul>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<hr/>Our retribution paladin guides are always updated with the latest information from in-game experience, simulations, and logs; make sure to check our changelog to this page by clicking on <b>View Changelog</b> at the top of the page.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
